      },
      {
        "id": "M08-SR-Q04",
        "prompt": "Which reasonable alternative would challenge your treatment of this outcome, and under what evidence would it win: Enforce atomic authoritative workflows with schema constraints and rebuildable derived state."
      },
      {
        "id": "M08-SR-Q05",
        "prompt": "What operational, security, cost, or ownership consequence is least supported in your treatment of this outcome: Explain and test WAL ordering, checkpoints, redo/undo, group commit, and durable acknowledgement."
